sequenceDiagram
    participant Body as ChBody shape
    participant Solver as Contact solver
    participant Container as Contact container
    participant Reporter as Contact reporter
    participant Logger as CSV logger
    participant Graph as Graph generator
    Body->>Solver: candidates + constraints
    Solver->>Container: points, normal, force
    Container->>Reporter: ReportAllContacts(callback)
    Reporter->>Logger: count, pair, force xyz
    Logger->>Graph: write CSV
    Graph->>Graph: force/count/event plots
